WEBVTT

00:00:08.580 --> 00:00:11.250
Kana, hold out your hands.

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:13.200
Here.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:14.700
This is a precious treasure,

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:17.750
the only one there is,
handed down through our family.

00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:23.000
I'm giving it to you.
Take care of it while I'm away, okay?

00:00:41.330 --> 00:00:44.410
<i>Tell me, do you remember?</i>

00:00:44.410 --> 00:00:48.330
<i>Yes, the wondrous God-given power you have,</i>

00:00:48.330 --> 00:00:54.160
<i>like sleight of hand without any tricks?</i>

00:00:54.160 --> 00:00:57.950
<i>Tell me, have you already forgotten?</i>

00:00:57.950 --> 00:01:01.120
<i>Those dreamlike, heart-shaped</i>

00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:06.500
<i>flower-bouquet-like words of yours?</i>

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:12.790
<i>I'm sure, I'm sure</i>

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:16.410
<i>this key will open your treasure box</i>

00:01:16.410 --> 00:01:22.660
<i>and let you remember them tonight</i>

00:01:22.660 --> 00:01:25.540
<i>Farewell!</i>

00:01:25.540 --> 00:01:26.830
<i>Watch me now,</i>

00:01:26.830 --> 00:01:30.040
<i>I'm gently, quietly going to disappear,</i>

00:01:30.040 --> 00:01:31.950
<i>so find me</i>

00:01:31.950 --> 00:01:33.160
<i>I'm over here</i>

00:01:33.160 --> 00:01:38.290
<i>Our long, long night of secrets is beginning</i>

00:01:38.290 --> 00:01:39.580
<i>Come after me</i>

00:01:39.580 --> 00:01:44.750
<i>Once you see the twinkle of my tearstains,</i>

00:01:44.750 --> 00:01:47.620
<i>catch me with your voice</i>

00:01:47.620 --> 00:01:52.370
<i>and the magic words only the two of us know</i>

00:02:01.290 --> 00:02:04.040
It's been a month since I came here.

00:02:06.910 --> 00:02:09.410
You don't have to overdo things, okay?

00:02:09.410 --> 00:02:11.950
Do whatever you most want to do.

00:02:11.950 --> 00:02:13.910
Big brother, good luck!

00:02:13.910 --> 00:02:18.040
Mm-hmm. Thanks. Bye.

00:02:20.540 --> 00:02:24.450
Your mother believes in you, Makoto.

00:02:24.450 --> 00:02:27.370
I wonder how everyone is doing.

00:02:27.370 --> 00:02:29.580
Ah, jeez, we're soaked to the skin.

00:02:29.580 --> 00:02:32.620
I told you we should have called for a ride.

00:02:32.620 --> 00:02:35.700
Well, I thought it was
going to let up right away.

00:02:35.700 --> 00:02:37.370
Are you okay, Hatena?

00:02:37.370 --> 00:02:39.370
Mm-hmm, thanks--

00:02:41.790 --> 00:02:42.620
Huh?

00:02:42.620 --> 00:02:44.000
Makoto, you sicko!

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:45.370
Get out of here!

00:02:45.370 --> 00:02:47.080
S-Sorry!

00:02:47.080 --> 00:02:48.660
Poor guy.

00:02:48.660 --> 00:02:51.950
But never mind him. I don't want
to catch a cold. Can I use your bath?

00:02:51.950 --> 00:02:53.080
A bath?

00:02:53.080 --> 00:02:56.790
And while we're at it, Ema-<i>san</i>
and Mariah, you should join us, okay?

00:02:56.790 --> 00:02:58.660
Huh? Us, too?

00:02:58.660 --> 00:03:02.330
Please, feel free. Kokomi-<i>sama </i>and Mariah-<i>sama</i>,

00:03:02.330 --> 00:03:05.660
you are both like family here
in the Hoshisato home.

00:03:05.660 --> 00:03:10.080
That settles that! Let's go take a bath!

00:03:11.870 --> 00:03:16.370
Hatena looked pretty chilled.
She'll probably want a bath right away.

00:03:16.370 --> 00:03:19.950
I need to make up for my goof-up, too.

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:24.830
Hatena, I haven't taken a bath
at your place in a long time!

00:03:24.830 --> 00:03:29.910
Come along. Today is a great
opportunity to take a bath together.

00:03:29.910 --> 00:03:33.120
Ugh, I don't like baths.

00:03:33.120 --> 00:03:37.370
Gah! You look just like a dolly!
You're as cute as ever!

00:03:37.370 --> 00:03:41.410
I'm so happy you're going to bathe with us!

00:03:41.410 --> 00:03:43.790
Easy! Yumemi is anxious enough as it is!

00:03:43.790 --> 00:03:45.540
Kokomi-<i>sama</i>, that is enough.

00:03:45.540 --> 00:03:47.620
Huh?

00:03:47.620 --> 00:03:50.250
There, that ought to do it.

00:03:50.250 --> 00:03:54.040
Hatena, are you taking that
muffler into the bath with you?

00:03:54.040 --> 00:03:58.580
Of course I am.
I don't need you stealing it from me.

00:03:58.580 --> 00:03:59.950
Huh? Makoto-<i>kun</i>?

00:03:59.950 --> 00:04:01.500
Oh, Makoto-<i>sama</i>...

00:04:01.500 --> 00:04:03.250
Are you taking a bath, too?

00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:06.660
Makoto-<i>sama</i>, I am afraid
that is out of the question.

00:04:15.370 --> 00:04:20.290
Mariah-<i>san</i>, you're amazing.
Yours may be even bigger than Mama's.

00:04:20.290 --> 00:04:22.910
You can touch them if you like.

00:04:23.910 --> 00:04:28.950
Wow, you even smell like Mother.

00:04:30.910 --> 00:04:33.830
I swear, Makoto will pay for that!

00:04:33.830 --> 00:04:36.370
But that one was just
an unlucky accident, right?

00:04:36.370 --> 00:04:37.370
Yeah, an accident!

00:04:37.370 --> 00:04:40.870
I've been saying that it's because things
like this happen that there's a problem!

00:04:40.870 --> 00:04:43.250
Say, I've been wondering something.

00:04:43.250 --> 00:04:45.120
If you have such trouble dealing with boys,

00:04:45.120 --> 00:04:48.160
why did you agree to have
Makoto-<i>kun </i>live with you?

00:04:48.160 --> 00:04:51.870
Our research division
was surprised by that, too.

00:04:51.870 --> 00:04:56.450
Well, Makoto used to look like that and all...

00:04:56.450 --> 00:04:58.000
Like what?

00:05:02.040 --> 00:05:06.790
Hold on, Hatena. Are you saying
you thought that Makoto-<i>kun </i>was a girl?

00:05:06.790 --> 00:05:08.200
For real?

00:05:09.500 --> 00:05:12.290
Well, I didn't have any idea!

00:05:12.290 --> 00:05:14.000
Whoo!

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:17.660
And I did think that it was nice
that Makoto was like a prince,

00:05:17.660 --> 00:05:23.120
and that a girl that dressed like a boy, or a
girl that was cool would have been just fine.

00:05:23.120 --> 00:05:26.410
I never imagined he was an actual boy, though...

00:05:26.410 --> 00:05:31.620
Aw, I guess in this case, Makoto-<i>kun</i>'s
pretty face worked against him.

00:05:31.620 --> 00:05:35.200
Kokomi, what do you think I should do?

00:05:36.750 --> 00:05:40.620
Whatever you do,
you need to talk about this with him first.

00:05:42.700 --> 00:05:47.700
I'm sorry. All of these mistakes
are because of my carelessness.

00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:53.370
Well, luckily lechery is an indispensable
part of being a leading man.

00:05:53.370 --> 00:05:55.750
I am not particularly bothered by it.

00:05:55.750 --> 00:05:59.120
In fact, I am almost apologetic
that you had to see me like that.

00:05:59.120 --> 00:06:01.620
I wish you had come in with us.

00:06:01.620 --> 00:06:05.700
Stop that, Yumemi! I'm still mad about this!

00:06:05.700 --> 00:06:08.830
Now, now, let's put a pin in this for now.

00:06:08.830 --> 00:06:12.580
Instead, Hatena, you have
something to confess, don't you?

00:06:12.580 --> 00:06:17.580
It's okay; Makoto-<i>kun </i>is hardly in
any position to be upset right now.

00:06:17.580 --> 00:06:24.660
Um... listen...
I have something I have to tell you...

00:06:27.450 --> 00:06:30.660
...and that's what happened. I'm sorry.

00:06:30.660 --> 00:06:36.160
Until we met again,
I honestly thought that you were really a girl.

00:06:36.160 --> 00:06:40.080
Oh... So that's why you've
been at such odds with me.

00:06:40.080 --> 00:06:46.330
We are terribly sorry, Makoto-<i>sama</i>.
The Hoshisato family is at fault.

00:06:46.330 --> 00:06:49.160
N-No, I should be apologizing.

00:06:49.160 --> 00:06:52.870
I had no idea that's why
you were so upset, Hatena.

00:06:54.000 --> 00:06:58.040
I'll go rent out a room somewhere nearby.

00:06:59.040 --> 00:07:01.580
You don't need to go rushing into anything...

00:07:01.580 --> 00:07:03.870
I'd like to do something on my own this time.

00:07:03.870 --> 00:07:06.290
I've been relying on the
Hoshisato family's hospitality,

00:07:06.290 --> 00:07:08.540
and this is how that turned out.

00:07:08.540 --> 00:07:13.200
Hatena, would it be okay if
I came over only to learn magic?

00:07:13.200 --> 00:07:14.250
Why?

00:07:14.250 --> 00:07:15.290
Huh?

00:07:15.290 --> 00:07:16.450
Hatena?

00:07:16.450 --> 00:07:20.950
Makoto, have you forgotten your promise
that you would be my partner?!

00:07:20.950 --> 00:07:26.870
No, I haven't! But Hatena, since
you can't stand living with a boy, I thought...

00:07:26.870 --> 00:07:33.290
It's true... I've been telling
you to get out all this time.

00:07:33.290 --> 00:07:37.000
This whole misunderstanding was also mine.

00:07:37.000 --> 00:07:41.410
The blame rests entirely with me!

00:07:41.410 --> 00:07:45.120
But... But all this time...

00:07:45.120 --> 00:07:48.250
I've been waiting for you, Makoto!

00:07:48.250 --> 00:07:50.250
I don't care anymore!

00:07:51.410 --> 00:07:53.410
Big sister...

00:07:58.000 --> 00:08:03.250
Jeeves-<i>san</i>, we're spending the night here.
I'll sleep in Hatena's room.

00:08:04.540 --> 00:08:09.200
Don't worry. Come morning,
she'll calm down and you can talk to her.

00:08:09.200 --> 00:08:13.200
After the storm comes the calm.
Now that this is out, she will come around.

00:08:13.200 --> 00:08:16.040
That is the way these things go, Makoto-<i>sama</i>.

00:08:26.330 --> 00:08:28.950
Makoto! Wait!

00:08:33.080 --> 00:08:34.700
What's wrong, Makoto?

00:08:34.700 --> 00:08:38.830
It's nothing. I fell down.

00:08:40.370 --> 00:08:44.000
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:08:44.000 --> 00:08:47.160
Welcome to the Hoshisato Mamoru Stage Show!

00:08:48.450 --> 00:08:54.120
All right, I will need a volunteer
from the audience. You there!

00:08:55.540 --> 00:09:00.410
My, that's quite the bandage you
have there. Did something happen?

00:09:03.910 --> 00:09:08.790
Are you okay? Here, turn toward me. That's it...

00:09:09.790 --> 00:09:13.080
There, all done. Hold out your hands.

00:09:13.080 --> 00:09:15.620
This is for you.

00:09:15.620 --> 00:09:19.250
Wow, amazing! Thank you!

00:09:19.250 --> 00:09:24.000
Hey, now, I haven't even
started doing my tricks.

00:09:25.750 --> 00:09:26.870
"Lounge"

00:09:26.870 --> 00:09:27.580
"Lounge"
Uncle, please teach me how to do your tricks!

00:09:27.580 --> 00:09:30.500
Uncle, please teach me how to do your tricks!

00:09:30.500 --> 00:09:33.080
Why do you want to become a magician?

00:09:33.080 --> 00:09:36.450
I got bullied today. But you know what?

00:09:36.450 --> 00:09:40.160
After I saw your tricks,
my sadness went far away!

00:09:40.160 --> 00:09:44.120
I think making sadness go away
with magic is amazing.

00:09:44.120 --> 00:09:47.790
I want to make others' sadness
disappear and leave them smiling.

00:09:47.790 --> 00:09:51.790
Makoto-<i>kun</i>, I think you have a talent.

00:09:51.790 --> 00:09:56.160
There's only one thing that
it's okay to steal from others.

00:09:56.160 --> 00:09:59.290
You know pretty well
what's important, don't you?

00:10:01.500 --> 00:10:04.950
When you get older, and prove that
you're a man who can keep a promise,

00:10:04.950 --> 00:10:06.790
come by again.

00:10:06.790 --> 00:10:10.540
When you do, I'll teach you everything I know.

00:10:10.540 --> 00:10:12.250
Right!

00:10:16.870 --> 00:10:21.160
Making the person closest to me cry
means I've failed as a magician.

00:10:21.160 --> 00:10:23.910
How can I be her partner?

00:10:23.910 --> 00:10:28.450
Makoto, have you forgotten your promise
that you would be my partner?!

00:10:28.450 --> 00:10:31.410
Then, Makoto, you can be my partner!

00:10:31.410 --> 00:10:33.700
That's a promise!

00:10:33.700 --> 00:10:36.000
Ah! That's it!

00:10:36.000 --> 00:10:42.160
Hatena wasn't agreeing to be my
partner in magic, but in being a thief!

00:10:42.160 --> 00:10:44.750
I've misinterpreted her badly.

00:10:45.750 --> 00:10:50.330
But even if that's the case, I could...

00:10:58.330 --> 00:11:01.330
Kokomi, thanks.

00:11:05.040 --> 00:11:09.540
Maybe I don't really
want a master thief partner.

00:11:11.200 --> 00:11:16.410
But I'm the one who's been awful
to Makoto, just because he's a boy.

00:11:17.580 --> 00:11:21.370
I don't even know what I want to do anymore.

00:11:23.160 --> 00:11:25.500
Have you calmed down a little?

00:11:25.500 --> 00:11:28.250
Kokomi? About earlier...

00:11:28.250 --> 00:11:31.080
It's okay. We're friends, aren't we?

00:11:32.290 --> 00:11:35.080
Is that...? Huh? No way!

00:11:36.160 --> 00:11:37.620
What?! Hey, watch it!

00:11:37.620 --> 00:11:39.290
What's the matter?

00:11:39.290 --> 00:11:40.830
It's gone! It's gone!

00:11:40.830 --> 00:11:42.750
What's gone?

00:11:42.750 --> 00:11:44.160
Big sister?

00:11:44.160 --> 00:11:48.660
It's gone! Mother's crest is gone!

00:11:48.660 --> 00:11:51.000
This is the only window that was open.

00:11:51.000 --> 00:11:53.160
If an intruder had entered from outside,

00:11:53.160 --> 00:11:56.330
a defensive Artifact would have responded.

00:11:56.330 --> 00:11:58.620
Then they didn't come from outside?

00:11:58.620 --> 00:12:01.950
Forgive me for asking, Kokomi-<i>sama</i>,
but where is Mariah-<i>sama</i>?

00:12:01.950 --> 00:12:04.790
I can't seem to find her.

00:12:04.790 --> 00:12:07.790
You're not saying it was Mariah!

00:12:07.790 --> 00:12:09.370
Yumemi-<i>chan</i>?

00:12:11.040 --> 00:12:12.790
This is my fault.

00:12:12.790 --> 00:12:16.500
I'm sorry, Hatena. Your precious treasure...

00:12:16.500 --> 00:12:18.620
It's not your fault, Kokomi.

00:12:18.620 --> 00:12:22.580
Everyone should make sure
that nothing else has been stolen.

00:12:22.580 --> 00:12:26.250
Kokomi-<i>sama</i>, would you please call your parents?

00:12:26.250 --> 00:12:27.160
Yumemi?

00:12:27.160 --> 00:12:28.700
On it.

00:12:30.790 --> 00:12:34.660
Mariah-<i>san </i>has blond hair and big boobs.

00:12:34.660 --> 00:12:37.830
Not very common, so she should be easy to find.

00:12:37.830 --> 00:12:41.580
This is amazing, Yumemi-<i>chan</i>.

00:12:41.580 --> 00:12:46.950
Her PC is an Artifact. Only Yumemi can use it.

00:12:46.950 --> 00:12:49.000
Found her.

00:12:49.000 --> 00:12:54.000
I'm predicting her escape route
from security camera and transit data.

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:56.870
The probability that she
is heading for Tokyo Bay...

00:12:56.870 --> 00:12:59.250
...is the highest...

00:12:59.250 --> 00:13:00.950
Yumemi-<i>chan</i>!

00:13:00.950 --> 00:13:06.250
I'm okay... Just sleepy...
This is the toll I pay...

00:13:06.250 --> 00:13:11.290
Big brother... Big sister... get that crest...

00:13:12.750 --> 00:13:15.290
Makoto, look after Yumemi.

00:13:19.410 --> 00:13:21.950
I'll get that crest back.

00:13:21.950 --> 00:13:24.950
Hold on, Hatena! You're planning to go alone?

00:13:24.950 --> 00:13:26.540
Talk to Ema-<i>san </i>and Kikyouin-<i>san</i>--

00:13:26.540 --> 00:13:29.830
I'm a master thief. This is my job.

00:13:29.830 --> 00:13:32.500
I'm the one Mother entrusted her crest to!

00:13:32.500 --> 00:13:34.450
Then at least let me come with you!

00:13:34.450 --> 00:13:37.290
No! If I involve you in anything dangerous,

00:13:37.290 --> 00:13:39.660
Father and Mother will yell at me!

00:13:39.660 --> 00:13:41.700
What? Hatena, I can...

00:13:41.700 --> 00:13:45.080
Muff-<i>kun</i>, if you would? Golden Wings,

00:13:45.080 --> 00:13:47.290
lead the way!

00:13:50.540 --> 00:13:52.250
Hatena...

00:13:58.000 --> 00:14:04.250
I'm heating up. I have to finish
everything up before my body gives out.

00:14:04.250 --> 00:14:07.290
Then at least let me come with you!

00:14:07.290 --> 00:14:09.200
Thank you, Makoto.

00:14:11.250 --> 00:14:15.000
But this promise is between me and Mother.

00:14:16.290 --> 00:14:20.830
It appears that Mistress Kana
has dashed off by herself.

00:14:20.830 --> 00:14:25.290
Kokomi-<i>sama </i>and Ema are alarmed,
and are preparing to go after her.

00:14:26.700 --> 00:14:30.120
Is there anything I can do besides wait?

00:14:30.120 --> 00:14:33.870
In order to obtain anything,
there is a toll that must be paid.

00:14:33.870 --> 00:14:36.370
At times, that toll is not of equal value.

00:14:36.370 --> 00:14:40.330
Even so, people seek after the things they want.

00:14:40.330 --> 00:14:44.580
What is it that you were seeking by coming here?

00:14:45.660 --> 00:14:48.040
What I was seeking...?

00:14:49.410 --> 00:14:53.750
I came here because I wanted
to see everyone else smile! But...

00:14:54.750 --> 00:14:57.500
Your Artifact is in overdrive.

00:14:57.500 --> 00:15:00.950
It seems that the conditions
to complete your contract have been met.

00:15:03.450 --> 00:15:06.910
Contract? Not to mention, Artifact?

00:15:06.910 --> 00:15:13.000
Your wand's true name is Airgetlám.
It is indisputably an Artifact.

00:15:14.580 --> 00:15:18.120
A contract with an Artifact
is secured by knowing its true name,

00:15:18.120 --> 00:15:21.620
and giving it a provisional name.

00:15:21.620 --> 00:15:26.830
Please go forth, Makoto-<i>sama</i>,
to preserve those smiles.

00:15:26.830 --> 00:15:32.250
It is also what Mistress Kana wishes.

00:15:32.250 --> 00:15:40.000
Airgetlám, contract with me and
let's go help Hatena! Your name will be...

00:15:46.040 --> 00:15:50.250
Muff-<i>kun</i>, do you sense the crest anywhere?

00:15:50.250 --> 00:15:51.910
That boat looks out of place.

00:15:51.910 --> 00:15:55.250
My goodness, you got here surprisingly fast.

00:15:55.250 --> 00:15:56.910
Mariah-<i>san</i>!

00:15:56.910 --> 00:16:00.000
So you really were the one who stole the crest!

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:05.120
That's correct. But I'm only
doing the same thing you do.

00:16:05.120 --> 00:16:07.410
Give me back Mama's crest!

00:16:12.000 --> 00:16:14.870
Aw, too bad. You were so close, too.

00:16:14.870 --> 00:16:17.620
Never underestimate the daughter
of the master thief Maeve!

00:16:17.620 --> 00:16:20.410
Muff-<i>kun</i>, sword mode!

00:16:20.410 --> 00:16:24.290
Let's see what you've got! Green Servants!

00:16:46.000 --> 00:16:49.000
I didn't want to have to get rough with you.

00:16:49.000 --> 00:16:50.450
Sorry about this.

00:16:51.580 --> 00:16:56.790
This crest is something valuable,
used in the creation of new Artifacts.

00:16:56.790 --> 00:16:59.450
My sister is the one who can use it best,

00:16:59.450 --> 00:17:02.410
but even so, there are plenty
of people who want it.

00:17:02.410 --> 00:17:05.000
Your sister? What do you mean?

00:17:05.000 --> 00:17:07.910
It's a bit late for this,
but let me introduce myself.

00:17:07.910 --> 00:17:11.410
I am the younger sister of your mother.

00:17:11.410 --> 00:17:15.910
I was told by our elder to get close
to you so I could get the crest back.

00:17:15.910 --> 00:17:17.750
N-No way!

00:17:17.750 --> 00:17:20.450
I was hoping to handle this peacefully.

00:17:22.120 --> 00:17:25.870
You're the one who spoiled that plan.

00:17:28.200 --> 00:17:29.120
--What the--?!
--Whoa!

00:17:29.120 --> 00:17:30.870
Report this to Mariah-<i>sama</i>!

00:17:30.870 --> 00:17:32.160
Right!

00:17:36.870 --> 00:17:40.410
It looks like they were anticipating us.

00:17:42.080 --> 00:17:48.080
We are going to need a hero they aren't
anticipating to beat them at this game.

00:17:48.080 --> 00:17:51.450
You can skip the anime narration,
just stay on your toes!

00:17:51.450 --> 00:17:54.160
Of course I will.

00:17:54.160 --> 00:17:57.450
At last, you've settled down.

00:17:58.910 --> 00:18:03.410
You must have realized that harm
may come to you if you resist.

00:18:05.330 --> 00:18:06.870
Muff-<i>kun</i>...

00:18:06.870 --> 00:18:11.500
The ship looks like it's ready
to go, too. Time to leave.

00:18:11.500 --> 00:18:13.000
W-Wait!

00:18:13.000 --> 00:18:18.580
Farewell, my adorable niece.
We will probably never see each other again.

00:18:19.620 --> 00:18:22.910
Am I powerless to stop her alone?

00:18:22.910 --> 00:18:27.500
Can I not even keep my
promise to Mother by myself?

00:18:27.500 --> 00:18:30.700
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:18:33.200 --> 00:18:37.200
Welcome to Shiranui Makoto's Stage Show!

00:18:37.200 --> 00:18:39.620
Ha, that's quite the bold entrance.

00:18:39.620 --> 00:18:41.540
Makoto!

00:18:41.540 --> 00:18:42.790
Here we go!

00:18:42.790 --> 00:18:46.450
Airgetlám, your name will be...

00:18:46.450 --> 00:18:48.500
Smile Stick!

00:18:49.500 --> 00:18:51.290
For my first trick,

00:18:51.290 --> 00:18:54.450
some well-known vanishing magic!

00:18:59.160 --> 00:19:00.370
Wh-Whoa!

00:19:00.370 --> 00:19:02.700
Sorry, just put up with it for a bit.

00:19:04.540 --> 00:19:07.700
Please return what you have stolen.

00:19:07.700 --> 00:19:10.790
Nothing doing.
In fact, as long as you have this,

00:19:10.790 --> 00:19:14.750
people are going to keep coming
after you in search of Artifacts,

00:19:14.750 --> 00:19:17.410
including members of the family.

00:19:19.450 --> 00:19:21.410
Is that what you want?

00:19:22.830 --> 00:19:26.620
Mother was tormented by the fact
that people were meeting with tragic fates

00:19:26.620 --> 00:19:28.580
because of the items that she created.

00:19:29.540 --> 00:19:33.290
I'm going to steal that grief from Mother!

00:19:33.290 --> 00:19:36.540
I want to be a master thief that steals sadness!

00:19:37.830 --> 00:19:42.410
There's only one thing that
it's okay to steal from others.

00:19:42.410 --> 00:19:45.330
That's right! I've made my decision as well!

00:19:45.330 --> 00:19:50.330
To preserve smiles! And to become
your partner to do so, Hatena!

00:19:51.500 --> 00:19:52.830
Makoto...

00:19:52.830 --> 00:19:57.290
Such a fine resolution. I'm losing my patience!

00:19:58.580 --> 00:20:00.410
Smile Stick!

00:20:04.580 --> 00:20:07.160
Vanishing Magic!

00:20:07.160 --> 00:20:08.700
Muff-<i>kun</i>!

00:20:11.290 --> 00:20:13.250
A distraction?!

00:20:13.250 --> 00:20:17.540
Smile Stick Illusion!

00:20:32.700 --> 00:20:35.250
You've beaten me this time.

00:20:35.250 --> 00:20:37.410
Mariah-<i>san</i>...

00:20:37.410 --> 00:20:41.790
But don't think that everyone
will be as easy on you as I was.

00:20:43.290 --> 00:20:46.250
Welcome to the Cursed Star family.

00:20:46.250 --> 00:20:49.790
May the star's guidance be upon you as well.

00:20:51.410 --> 00:20:52.750
Let's go.

00:20:59.870 --> 00:21:02.080
It looks like they got away.

00:21:02.080 --> 00:21:03.790
How's Hatena?

00:21:05.040 --> 00:21:07.750
They both look okay.

00:21:07.750 --> 00:21:09.040
Makoto!

00:21:09.040 --> 00:21:12.040
This must be the toll, huh?

00:21:12.040 --> 00:21:17.700
Hatena, it's incredible that you put up
with this so long to be a master thief.

00:21:17.700 --> 00:21:22.660
Do you think I'll be able to
serve as your partner like this?

00:21:27.120 --> 00:21:28.830
Sure you will.

00:21:31.160 --> 00:21:33.160
You already are.

00:21:34.200 --> 00:21:37.790
Makoto, you're my partner.

00:21:37.790 --> 00:21:39.200
Hatena...

00:21:39.200 --> 00:21:42.750
Thank you for keeping your promise.

00:21:44.080 --> 00:21:46.910
A-Anyhow, I look forward to working with you.

00:21:46.910 --> 00:21:50.290
M-M-Me, too...

00:21:51.290 --> 00:21:52.870
I-I'm feeling feverish, too...

00:21:52.870 --> 00:21:54.790
Hatena, are you okay?

00:21:59.200 --> 00:22:02.120
Don't call me Hatena...

00:22:02.500 --> 00:22:08.290
<i>My path now begins</i>

00:22:08.290 --> 00:22:16.660
<i>I've unleashed the hidden light of one future</i>

00:22:20.370 --> 00:22:23.040
<i>I've been on the hunt</i>

00:22:23.040 --> 00:22:27.080
<i>to find my furthest dreams</i>

00:22:27.080 --> 00:22:30.250
<i>I want to shine even brighter</i>

00:22:30.250 --> 00:22:35.330
<i>The "someday" that my former self prayed for</i>

00:22:35.330 --> 00:22:40.500
<i>is still far away, but I'll catch up</i>

00:22:40.500 --> 00:22:45.540
<i>"Miracle" is such an embarrassingly vague word</i>

00:22:45.540 --> 00:22:50.700
<i>My timeframe has neither forever nor a moment</i>

00:22:50.700 --> 00:22:57.950
<i>I move forward one step at a time to my voice</i>

00:22:57.950 --> 00:23:01.750
<i>No matter what awaits me</i>

00:23:01.750 --> 00:23:03.080
<i>beyond this pain</i>

00:23:03.080 --> 00:23:05.330
<i>I'll once again, yes once again</i>

00:23:05.330 --> 00:23:08.080
<i>leap up and shine</i>

00:23:08.080 --> 00:23:11.910
<i>Yeah, I'll put into words</i>

00:23:11.910 --> 00:23:13.450
<i>the view laid out before me</i>

00:23:13.450 --> 00:23:16.700
<i>and let it ring out dozens,</i>

00:23:16.700 --> 00:23:20.370
<i>even hundreds of times</i>

00:23:20.370 --> 00:23:24.660
<i>What color do you suppose love is?</i>

00:23:24.660 --> 00:23:30.370
<i>I've unleashed my hidden light</i>

00:23:32.120 --> 00:23:38.450
"What sports are you good at?"

00:23:40.000 --> 00:23:52.040
"Makoto"

00:23:52.040 --> 00:24:01.950
"See you next time"
